main","cn":"内容区","en":"Main","desc":"页面主体，居中限宽，两侧留白","desc_en":"The page’s main content, centered with a maximum width and side whitespace"},{"key":"footer","cn":"页脚","en":"Footer","desc":"版权、备案、次要链接的收纳处","desc_en":"Holds copyright, regulatory information, and secondary links"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"静态顶栏","en":"Static","demo":"<span class=\"topnav-wire\" style=\"width:120px\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-bar\"><i class=\"topnav-wire-logo\"></i><span class=\"topnav-wire-links\"><i></i><i></i></span></span><span class=\"topnav-wire-body\" style=\"padding:6px 0\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-col\" style=\"min-height:22px\"></span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"topnav-wire\" style=\"width:120px\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-bar\"><i class=\"topnav-wire-logo\"></i><span class=\"topnav-wire-links\"><i></i><i></i></span></span><span class=\"topnav-wire-body\" style=\"padding:6px 0\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-col\" style=\"min-height:22px\"></span></span></span>","when":"页面一屏看完，不用吸顶","when_en":"For a short page that does not need persistent navigation"},{"cn":"吸顶顶栏","en":"Sticky","demo":"<span class=\"topnav-wire\" style=\"width:120px\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-bar\" style=\"box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 var(--brand)\"><i class=\"topnav-wire-logo\"></i><span class=\"topnav-wire-links\"><i></i><i></i></span></span><span class=\"topnav-wire-body\" style=\"padding:6px 0\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-col\" style=\"min-height:22px\"></span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"topnav-wire\" style=\"width:120px\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-bar\" style=\"box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 var(--brand)\"><i class=\"topnav-wire-logo\"></i><span class=\"topnav-wire-links\"><i></i><i></i></span></span><span class=\"topnav-wire-body\" style=\"padding:6px 0\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-col\" style=\"min-height:22px\"></span></span></span>","when":"长页面需要持续提供导航入口时","when_en":"When navigation should remain available while users scroll through a long page"},{"cn":"双层顶栏","en":"Stacked","demo":"<span class=\"topnav-wire\" style=\"width:120px\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-bar\"><i class=\"topnav-wire-logo\"></i><span class=\"topnav-wire-links\"><i></i><i></i></span></span><span class=\"topnav-wire-bar\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-links\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></span><span class=\"topnav-wire-body\" style=\"padding:5px 0\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-col\" style=\"min-height:16px\"></span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"topnav-wire\" style=\"width:120px\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-bar\"><i class=\"topnav-wire-logo\"></i><span class=\"topnav-wire-links\"><i></i><i></i></span></span><span class=\"topnav-wire-bar\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-links\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></span><span class=\"topnav-wire-body\" style=\"padding:5px 0\"><span class=\"topnav-wire-col\" style=\"min-height:16px\"></span></span></span>","when":"导航多到一层放不下时用","when_en":"When the navigation has too many items for a single row"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>按优先级组织顶栏</b>：品牌、主要入口与必要操作可随内容和屏幕重新编排","m":"topnav-zones"},{"t":"<b>内容区控制可读宽度</b>：根据内容类型、字号和设备测试 max-width，并保留适当边距","m":"topnav-maxwidth"},{"t":"<b>长页面顶栏吸顶</b>：position: sticky，滚多远都在手边","m":"topnav-sticky"},{"t":"<b>主操作只有一个</b>：右上角放全站最重要的那个按钮","m":"btn-primary-one"}],"dont":[{"t":"顶栏入口过多导致<b>换行</b>：保留核心入口，其余收进 {c:dropdown}","m":"topnav-cram","bad":true},{"t":"宽屏内容<b>未限宽</b>：行长过长会影响阅读","m":"topnav-fullwidth","bad":true},{"t":"入口全部做成按钮：导航应使用 {c:menu} 组织","m":"menu-crowded","bad":true},{"t":"顶栏和正文<b>用同一个底色</b>，分不清哪是导航","m":"topnav-flat","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"内容网站只有首页、文章、专题、关于和搜索五个一级入口，没有复杂层级。哪种页面结构更直接？","options":[{"id":"focused-top-navigation","label":"使用顶部导航布局，下方内容限宽，手机端收纳次要入口","feedback":"少量一级入口适合持续放在顶部，主要内容可以在完整宽度下保持清楚阅读。","correct":true},{"id":"permanent-sidebar","label":"使用常驻宽侧栏放五个入口，让正文一直占剩余区域","feedback":"侧栏更适合层级较深或工具型导航，当前少量入口会长期占用不必要的阅读宽度。","correct":false},{"id":"single-scroll-sections","label":"取消页面跳转，把文章、专题和关于全部接成一个长首页","feedback":"这些入口服务不同内容任务，强行合并会削弱独立网址、搜索和返回路径。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A content site has five top-level destinations—Home, Articles, Topics, About, and Search—with no deep hierarchy. Which page structure is direct?","options":[{"id":"focused-top-navigation","label":"Use a top-navigation layout, constrain reading width, and collect secondary entries on mobile","feedback":"A small set of primary destinations fits persistent top access while leaving the main content clear and wide.","correct":true},{"id":"permanent-sidebar","label":"Use a wide permanent sidebar for the five entries and leave the remaining width to articles","feedback":"Sidebars fit deeper or tool-oriented navigation; these few entries would consume reading width without adding clarity.","correct":false},{"id":"single-scroll-sections","label":"Remove page navigation and append Articles, Topics, and About into one long homepage","feedback":"These serve different content tasks, and merging them weakens distinct URLs, search, and return paths.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请把内容站组织为顶部导航布局：品牌、五个一级入口和搜索放在顶栏，正文设置适合阅读的最大宽度；手机把次要入口收进菜单。验证当前页高亮、长标题和吸顶后不遮挡正文。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Use a top-navigation layout for the content site: put brand, five primary destinations, and search in the top bar, constrain article width, and collect secondary entries on mobile. Verify current-page state, long titles, and sticky offset."}},"references":[{"title":"菜单设计清单：17 条 UX 准则","source":"NN/g","url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/menu-design/","title_en":"Menu-Design Checklist: 17 UX Guidelines"}],"scenes":["内容站与博客","产品官网","文档站","营销落地页"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Marketing site","m":"topnav-zones"},{"t":"Product with a few main sections","m":"topnav-maxwidth"},{"t":"Content that needs full page width","m":"topnav-sticky"},{"t":"Simple cross-page navigation","m":"btn-primary-one"}],"dont":[{"t":"Squeeze many deep sections into one row","m":"topnav-cram","bad":true},{"t":"Hide the active destination","m":"topnav-fullwidth","bad":true},{"t":"Let navigation wrap into an accidental second line","m":"menu-crowded","bad":true},{"t":"Copy the desktop row unchanged onto a phone","m":"topnav-flat","bad":true}],"scenes":["Company site","SaaS product","Portfolio","Simple dashboard"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);white-space:nowrap\">◆ Late-Night Frontend</b>\n        <span style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><span style=\"color:var(--text);font-weight:500\">Homepage</span><span>Column</span><span>Weekly</span><span>About</span></span>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px\">Subscribe</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;padding:2px 16px 8px\">\n        <div style=\"padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">How I used AI to build a website in one week</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\">Frontend notes · Yesterday · 8 minutes to read</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"padding:7px 0\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Five CSS Grid layouts you’ll use again and again</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\">Tutorial · 3 days ago · Read in 12 minutes</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:8px